{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Goggles are a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝#Hats","tailored"]," using ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and a ",["l","虫肉块","Bug Steak"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务#Rock Rejuvenation","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order. It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节#Emily's Outfit Services","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". There is a ≈2% chance to receive the gender-neutral outfit with the Goggles."]],["p",["There is a small chance to receive this hat from slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],", breaking ",["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","crates and barrels"],", chopping ",["l","树","trees"],", shaking trees with seeds, digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, or ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Goggles outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt234.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝#Shirts","Circuitboard Shirt"]," and ",["f","Baggy_Pants.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝#Pants","Baggy Pants"]," (dyed RGB value 60,99,62)."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can now be randomly obtained as part of an outfit from the Desert Festival. Small chance added to receive from various player actions."]]]]]]]}